# Same xHCI: USB root disk + keyboard + mouse, threaded 2 MiB write/sync/readback.
[xhci] xhci: HID keyboard ready
[xhci] xhci: HID mouse ready
block: disk1 is xhci
vfs: root is disk1p2 (ext2)
[wdemo] wdemo ember: window
[wdemo] wdemo: USB I/O started
[xhci] xhci: HID key 4
[wdemo] wdemo ember: key 0x4
[wdemo] wdemo: USB I/O and input verified
init: poweroff: stopping services
acpi: entering S5
screen: pixel 682,432 = ffffff
